[1bc10aed] 2026-10-28T14:50:43.659Z: When comparing FIPS codes, don't forget to strip whitespace from the state_fips value before joining.
[ffab65d7] 2026-10-28T14:30:41.533Z: Pad county FIPS to 5 digits when joining, else get mismatches with geographic data.
[1b30933a] 2026-09-19T06:00:32.109Z: Padded state FIPS worked for my query, but I still got inconsistent results. Check the county name case sensitivity after joining.